        "treatment": "Add a small fully countable pruning trace and correct the ceiling-aware guarantee plot.",
        "claimCorrections": [
          "The 1/12 boundary certifies the stated bound; it is not an exact empirical crossover.",
          "The curve is piecewise hyperbolic, with jumps, not a staircase.",
          "Independent sample designs produce different means; report each with its own provenance."
        ]
      },
