        "treatment": "Separate the two custody balances from session and recovery-queue transitions.",
        "claimCorrections": [
          "Returned collateral is not income.",
          "Payment, slashing and invented lifecycle states do not follow from the displayed TLA excerpt."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "observation-and-federation",
        "figureLabels": [
          "fig:fh-cochain-hand",
          "fig:fh-worked-example"
        ],
        "treatment": "Separate a matched-evidence detector comparison from the multi-harbor incident sequence.",
        "claimCorrections": [
          "Signed claims require matching sender, coordinate and context for direct comparison.",
          "209 is a fixture outcome count, not a universal detection guarantee.",
          "An ideal gossip lower bound is not a revocation completion deadline."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "editorialPrinciples": [
      "Preserve the causal progression from local writes through delegation, confinement, supervision, durable identity, exchange, settlement and federation.",
      "Teach a concrete failure and a hand-checkable trace before the general claim; state its hypotheses and reuse the example at the point of application.",
      "Replace counterpart illustrations rather than accumulating proposal plates. Give each figure one question; split unrelated mechanisms at their actual points of use.",
      "Distinguish theorem, design requirement, bounded-model result and sampled experiment. Put useful conditions in captions and production bookkeeping in provenance.",
      "The figure briefs do not establish a case for wholesale chapter reordering. Chapters 4, 6 and 7 remain candidates for a separate case-first pacing pass."
    ],
